  abilityId: 2860867
  abilityName: Don't be in a hurry.
  abilityDesc: 18 combo Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    boosts Def relative to Atk for 3 turns, boosts spark damage for 3 turns, 100%
    damage reduction for 2 turns & fills OD gauge
